{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39220","headline":"赠渔翁 · 韦庄","name":"赠渔翁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草衣荷笠鬓如霜，自说家编楚水阳。\n满岸秋风吹枳橘，遶陂烟雨种菰蒋。\n芦刀夜鱠红鳞腻，水甑朝蒸紫芋香。\n曾向五湖期范蠡，尔来空阔久相忘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39220.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39220","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}